{"id":"t2hs4tulrx7pao8jfyyr6juuw","title":"嘉信理财宣布所有客户可直接买入比特币","originalTitle":null,"summary":"嘉信理财（Charles Schwab）宣布所有客户现可在账户内直接购买比特币，涉及逾4000万美国用户。该服务4月以Schwab Crypto名义分阶段上线，支持BTC和ETH交易，每笔收取0.75%手续费，由Paxos提供子托管和交易执行，暂不向纽约州和路易斯安那州居民开放。","reason":"管理约13万亿美元资产的嘉信理财向逾4000万美国用户开放直接购买比特币，传统券商全面接入加密资产迈出关键一步。","source":{"name":"PANews"},"links":{"original":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a144ac-3e9f-758a-8a38-83f1e2af0c7c"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-16T12:25:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-16T12:28:29.932Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-16T12:28:29.932Z","category":"crypto-market","tags":["产品上线","比特币","交易所","Bitcoin","Ethereum"],"score":85,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"8ea58e90-b144-43a4-afab-6084ef143af2","title":"嘉信理财向美国散户开放BTC与ETH交易"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"8ea58e90-b144-43a4-afab-6084ef143af2","title":"嘉信理财向美国散户开放BTC与ETH交易"}],"topics":[{"slug":"bitcoin","name":"比特币 / BTC"},{"slug":"exchanges","name":"交易所"},{"slug":"crypto-market","name":"行情异动"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"ffjoI-HWgZOc","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}